{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526244",
      "title": "Keeping Dynamic Components Alive",
      "lectureOrder": 120,
      "videoOrder": 103,
      "sourceHash": "a019a1e1dd3fb09460f4c864fb5387aebc585d75537ece38f36b78804369e3e9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 5.75,
          "en": "Dynamic components are definitely an interesting feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.75,
          "end": 8.86,
          "en": "which can help you add certain features to your apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.86,
          "end": 10.65,
          "en": "in an easier way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.65,
          "end": 13.32,
          "en": "But here is an additional thing you should know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.32,
          "end": 15.58,
          "en": "about dynamic components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.58,
          "end": 19.423,
          "en": "Let's say in Manage Goals, we had an input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.53,
          "end": 25.15,
          "en": "Let's actually say we have a rapping div here, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.15,
          "end": 28.8,
          "en": "And then in here, we also have a input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.8,
          "end": 32.47,
          "en": "where the user is able to enter some goal name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.47,
          "end": 34.57,
          "en": "Now, this is just a dummy input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.57,
          "end": 37.12,
          "en": "we're not doing anything with its value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.12,
          "end": 40.22,
          "en": "But it would be realistic that we have one component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.22,
          "end": 41.81,
          "en": "or multiple components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.81,
          "end": 44.22,
          "en": "where the user is able to enter something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.22,
          "end": 47.04,
          "en": "and that we then load this component dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 48.73,
          "en": "with component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.73,
          "end": 51.66,
          "en": "Now here's the problem we'll face with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 54.177,
          "en": "In Manage Goals we have the input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.177,
          "end": 58.54,
          "en": "but if I enter a goal here and then before I save it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.54,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "I decide to go back to Active Goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.15,
          "en": "and then I come back to Manage Goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.15,
          "end": 66.98,
          "en": "You see what I entered is lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.98,
          "end": 68.21000000000001,
          "en": "And the reason for that is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.21000000000001,
          "end": 71.02,
          "en": "that when we switch our components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.02,
          "end": 73.46000000000001,
          "en": "the old component is really destroyed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.46000000000001,
          "end": 75.65,
          "en": "and removed from the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.65,
          "end": 76.63,
          "en": "And that of course means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.63,
          "end": 79.64,
          "en": "that anything we entered here into this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.64,
          "end": 81.66,
          "en": "is lost if we switch away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.66,
          "end": 85.03999999999999,
          "en": "because the input field is removed from the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.03999999999999,
          "end": 87.21000000000001,
          "en": "And when we go back to Manage Goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 89.68299999999999,
          "en": "a brand new input field is added again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.92,
          "end": 93.39,
          "en": "Now this is maybe not what you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.39,
          "end": 95.6,
          "en": "and Vue has a solution for that as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.6,
          "end": 100.6,
          "en": "It has another built in component, the keep-alive component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.91,
          "end": 105.143,
          "en": "And you can wrap that around your dynamic component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.50999999999999,
          "end": 110.59,
          "en": "So keep-alive works together with this component component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.59,
          "end": 113.35,
          "en": "with this dynamic component concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.35,
          "end": 115.75,
          "en": "And it does what the name implies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.75,
          "end": 119,
          "en": "Keep-alive allows you to tell Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119,
          "end": 124,
          "en": "that components should not be removed and deleted entirely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.74,
          "end": 128.6,
          "en": "but that instead their state should be saved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.6,
          "end": 132.06,
          "en": "That they should be cached behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.06,
          "end": 137.06,
          "en": "So with keep-alive added here, if we go back and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 142,
          "en": "if I enter some goal here and I go back to Active Goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "and then back to Manage Goals, this text is still here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.57999999999998,
          "end": 149.95,
          "en": "because behind the scenes, it was not entirely deleted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.95,
          "end": 152.63,
          "en": "but Vue kept all the information around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.63,
          "end": 156.16,
          "en": "ensuring that we're not losing this content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.16,
          "end": 158.18,
          "en": "And it depends on what you're building,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.18,
          "end": 160.41,
          "en": "whether you want keep-alive or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.41,
          "end": 162.773,
          "en": "But it's good to know that it exists.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
